566	    25	    /**
567	    26	     * What the office charges and insures for one item type. The two figures
568	    27	     * are revised on their own schedules — a rate revision repricing premiums
569	    28	     * need not revalue the items — but they are published together, as one row
570	    29	     * of the price list, because they describe the same insured thing.
571	    30	     */
